{"articleNo":"2378","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2378&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010년도 KT&G장학재단 국내대학원 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.12.01","hit":"14227","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">KT&amp;G 장학재단 2010년도 국내대학원 장학생 선발</span></p><hr><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 지원자격 및 선발분야</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 선발일 현재 대한민국 국적 보유자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 2010년도 상반기 국내대학원 입학 허가자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 2009년 9월 이후 국내 대학원 입학허가를 받아 2010년 1월 이후에 입학예정인자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 학위: 석사 / 박사</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 전공분야 : 순수자연과학 ( 수학, 물리학, 화학, 생물학 등)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 장학생 지원사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 각 과정 수료 및 졸업 시까지 등록금 전액 지원(입학금 포함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 지원기간 : 석사 2년, 박사 4년</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 전형 절차</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1차 : 서류전형</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2차 : 면접 (1차 서류전형 합격자에 한함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 지원서 접수 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009.12. 21.(월) ~ 2010. 1. 10.(일)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 접수방법 : 인터넷 홈페이지 온라인 접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">&nbsp;☞ http://scholarship.ktngtogether.com</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 온라인 제출 - 지원서, 자기소개서 및 학업계획서 각 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 오프라인 제출 - 대학원 입학허가 증빙서류 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 최근 2개년 성적증명서 원본 각 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 최종학교 졸업(재학)증명서 원본 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교수 추천서 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 어학검정증명서 및 해외증명서 (TOEFL, JLPT, HSK 등) 사본 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2007년 이후 응시 성적이어야 하며, TOEIC 및 TEPS 제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 최근 2년 내 전공 관련 대회입상/ 연구실적 증명자료.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 최근 1년 내 사회봉사활동 증빙서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 기초생활수급대상자, 차상위계층, 장애인 관련 증빙서류(해당자에한함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 오프라인 제출서류는 1차 합격자에 한하며 재단이 지정한 날짜까지 우편으로 제출.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 제출서류 미비 시 합격 취소. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 제출서류는 반환 되지 않습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 370.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -370.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">7. 기타 문의 사항&nbsp; :&nbsp; 해당 홈페이지 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(☞ http:// scholarship.ktngtogether.com)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 370.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -370.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 또는 전화 (☎ 02-3404-4584)로 문의</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 제출서류 접수처 :&nbsp; (우: 135-280) 서울시 강남구 대치동 1002 코스모타워 19층&nbsp; KT&amp;G 장학재단</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
